        "text_G7eEn9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>White candles are timeless. Their versatility makes them a go-to choice for just about any setting—from sacred spaces and centerpieces to modern dinner tables and intimate outdoor gatherings. At Kisco, our white candles aren’t just beautiful, they’re made to perform. Long burn times. Smooth, steady flames. No waxy odors. Just pure, quiet elegance.</p><p>Minimalist or ornate, religious or romantic—white candles blend seamlessly into any atmosphere. That’s what makes them so essential. Whether you're stocking up for a high-end event or simply want to keep a few on hand at home, shop now and discover the difference quality makes.</p><p>Browse the collection today and elevate every setting with the clean beauty of white candlelight.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
