          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>One size doesn’t fit all when it comes to candles. That’s why our collection of white unscented candles includes a wide range of sizes, shapes, and styles—each designed for a specific purpose and look. From slim tapers for elegant table settings to chunky pillars for dramatic displays, every option is thoughtfully crafted with clean-burning wax and a steady flame.</p><p>Hosting a large gathering? Curating décor for a venue? Planning a wedding? You’ll find everything you need in one place. Order now and enjoy built-in volume discounts with every bulk purchase. Quality, quantity, and style—delivered right to your door.</p>",
