          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Scented candles have their place, but sometimes less is more. Our white unscented candles are made for moments when fragrance would only get in the way. They burn cleanly, without smoke or soot, making them ideal for food settings, quiet reflection, or fragrance-sensitive environments.</p><p>Designed to provide light, not scent, these candles are especially popular for weddings, religious services, and professional settings where clarity and cleanliness matter most. No waxy residue. No cloying smells. Just a soft, steady glow that enhances the moment. </p><p>Shop now for unscented white candles that perform beautifully, every single time. Bulk and event-ready options available.<br/><br/></p>",
